    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOpen Viewing Friday 2nd Octover between 4-5pm \n\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to bring to the market 24 Tradaree Court, Shannon, a beautifully presented three-bedroom home which has been fully renovated to an exceptionally high standard throughout. \n\nThe property is presented in turnkey condition, with extensive upgrades carried out by the current owners, leaving little for the new owner to do. The accommodation is bright and spacious, with all three bedrooms offering good proportions and a modern, contemporary finish.\n\nThe heart of the home is the impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area, providing a bright and sociable space which is ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The property also benefits from a new kitchen and bathroom, complementing the overall standard of the renovation.\n\nFurther upgrades include triple-glazed windows and a new heating system, with the OFCH system having been replaced a number of years ago.\n\nTo the rear, the property also benefits from a converted shed which is currently laid out as a bar area, providing a fantastic additional space for entertaining or relaxing.\n\nLocated in the popular Tradaree Court development, the property is within easy reach of Shannon town centre and a wide range of local amenities, including shops, schools, sporting facilities, cafés and restaurants. Shannon Airport and the surrounding road network are also easily accessible.\n\n24 Tradaree Court offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a fully renovated three-bedroom home in excellent condition, combining modern accommodation, quality upgrades and a convenient location. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
